---
---
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
  <!-- 6. MAJOR TURNKEY DIFFERENTIATOR (Deep Navy Full-Width Feature) -->
  <section class="w-full py-14 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-primary to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
      <span class="font-label text-[11px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.2em] sm:tracking-[0.22em] uppercase font-semibold text-secondary-fixed block mb-2 sm:mb-3">
        The Integrated Advantage
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[56px] font-bold leading-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-4 sm:mb-6 text-on-primary">
        One Team. One Responsibility.<br/>One Complete Project.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-outline-variant max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10 sm:mb-20">
        Forget the anxiety of coordinating separate architects, civil contractors, and interior teams. Paanya Empire centralizes the entire lifecycle under one unified contract.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Horizontal Execution Pathway -->
      <div class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-20 overflow-x-auto pb-4 no-scrollbar">
        <div class="min-w-[680px] sm:min-w-[760px] relative flex items-center justify-between px-4">
          <!-- Connective Track -->
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-outline-variant/30 -translate-y-1/2 z-0"></div>
          <!-- Nodes -->
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">01</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">Design</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">02</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">Approvals</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">03</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">Estimation</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">04</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">Construction</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">05</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">MEP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">06</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">Interiors</span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center group">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary shadow-lg ring-4 ring-inverse-surface">
              <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold">07</span>
            </div>
            <span class="mt-2 sm:mt-3 font-label text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-on-primary">Handover</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Testimonial Callout Card -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-surface-container-lowest/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 mb-8 sm:mb-12 shadow-inner">
        <p class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl italic text-inverse-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          “I didn't need to coordinate with multiple contractors. Paanya Empire managed everything from soil testing to the keys.”
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 sm:w-9 sm:h-9 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary font-bold text-xs">
            AR
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <span class="font-headline text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold block text-on-primary">Ananya Roy</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-outline-variant block">The Ridge Residence, Villa 14</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 px-6 sm:px-9 py-3.5 sm:py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-medium text-[11px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.16em] sm:tracking-[0.18em] uppercase rounded-lg shadow-xl shadow-primary/20 transition-all" href="/services/turnkey">
          Discover Turnkey Construction
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. WHY PAANYA EMPIRE (Editorial 4-Feature Layout with Large Numbers) -->
  <section class="w-full py-14 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8 sm:mb-16">
        <span class="font-label text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] sm:tracking-[0.22em] text-primary block mb-2">
          Built Around Trust
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight">
          The Standards That Set Us Apart.
        </h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
        <!-- Feature 01 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary block mb-4 sm:mb-6">01</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">
              Quality &amp; Craftsmanship
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Zero compromises on structural steel grades, high-density concrete mixes, and 10-year structural warranty backing.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
            10-Yr Guarantee
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Feature 02 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary block mb-4 sm:mb-6">02</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">
              Transparent Process
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Detailed itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ), verified cloud drone photos, and zero hidden milestone expenses.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">receipt_long</span>
            Fixed-Cost BOQ
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Feature 03 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary block mb-4 sm:mb-6">03</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">
              End-to-End Management
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              One dedicated senior project director accountable for municipal permits, engineering, millwork, and occupancy.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">supervisor_account</span>
            Single Point Contact
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Feature 04 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary block mb-4 sm:mb-6">04</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">
              Customer-First Approach
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              We manage complex logistical challenges so you can focus entirely on creative lifestyle decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">sentiment_very_satisfied</span>
            Zero Friction
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
